		<updated>2024-11-12T00:13:21Z</updated>
		<published>2024-11-12T00:13:21Z</published>

					<content type="html" xml:base="/2024/12/22/natures-bell-curve/comment-page-1/#comment-1704246"><![CDATA[<p>Yes, and I find that seeing &#8220;things happen&#8221; in terms of the Bell Curve seems to help me &#8220;accept them unconditionally&#8221;. Once I deeply understand nature&#8217;s process, I find it impossible to &#8220;object to them and suffer&#8221;.  </p>
<p>It all hinges on understanding&#8230; or as Buddha put it, Right Comprehension. I suppose in the path to Right Comprehension, the devil is in the details. Obviously, mere platitudes can&#8217;t serve.</p>
]]></content>
		
