		<updated>2024-10-23T17:12:32Z</updated>
		<published>2024-10-23T17:12:32Z</published>

					<content type="html" xml:base="/2024/12/22/natures-bell-curve/comment-page-1/#comment-1704245"><![CDATA[<p>I&#8217;m right there with you, Carl. The way I see it is that &#8220;things happen&#8221; (the universe unfolding) and then we can either accept them unconditionally, or we can object to them and suffer.</p>
]]></content>
		
